{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"Dirac 算子"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Dirac算子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>设 $E$ 是 $\\mathbb Z_2$-分次向量丛. 对于 $E$ 上的微分算子 $D$, 若 $D$ 反转奇偶, 且 $D^2$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"广义Laplace算子","text":"广义 Laplace 算子"}},{"Plain":", 则称 $D$ 为 Dirac 算子.</p>\n"}]}}